  /** Tells the note types apart. Notes written through the API or the Console carry `mentioned_emails`. A status change made in the Console carries `type: status_change` with `previous_status`, `new_status`, `reason_code` and `reason_label`. Notes Didit adds carry `source`: `rule_action` (with `rule_uuid`) for a rule's `add_note` action, or `remediation_session` for a problem creating the user-action verification session. */
